{
  "chapter": "patterns/evaluation/online-guardrail",
  "tier": "micro",
  "notes": [
    "A rolling window over live outcomes. The guardrail trips the first time a full window",
    "falls below the floor, reports the index it tripped at, and stops evaluating —",
    "something else takes over from there, so it never observes what came after.",
    "`worstBps` is therefore the worst window seen up to and including the trip.",
    "Rates are basis points out of 10000, integers, so the floor comparison is exact.",
    "A window that is not yet full never trips: the first few requests are not a signal."
  ],
  "window": 4,
  "floorBps": 7500,
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "a-healthy-stream-never-trips",
      "outcomes": ["ok", "ok", "ok", "ok", "ok"],
      "result": { "tripped": false, "at": null, "worstBps": 10000 }
    },
    {
      "id": "a-partial-window-never-trips",
      "outcomes": ["bad", "bad", "bad"],
      "result": { "tripped": false, "at": null, "worstBps": null }
    },
    {
      "id": "a-full-window-below-the-floor-trips",
      "outcomes": ["ok", "bad", "bad", "bad"],
      "result": { "tripped": true, "at": 3, "worstBps": 2500 }
    },
    {
      "id": "exactly-at-the-floor-does-not-trip",
      "outcomes": ["ok", "ok", "ok", "bad"],
      "result": { "tripped": false, "at": null, "worstBps": 7500 }
    },
    {
      "id": "an-old-failure-rolls-out-of-the-window",
      "outcomes": ["bad", "ok", "ok", "ok", "ok", "ok"],
      "result": { "tripped": false, "at": null, "worstBps": 7500 }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-guardrail-trips-at-the-first-bad-window-and-stops-looking",
      "outcomes": ["ok", "bad", "bad", "bad", "bad", "bad"],
      "result": { "tripped": true, "at": 3, "worstBps": 2500 }
    },
    {
      "id": "a-recovery-after-tripping-is-still-a-trip",
      "outcomes": ["bad", "bad", "bad", "bad", "ok", "ok", "ok", "ok"],
      "result": { "tripped": true, "at": 3, "worstBps": 0 }
    },
    {
      "id": "no-traffic-never-trips",
      "outcomes": [],
      "result": { "tripped": false, "at": null, "worstBps": null }
    }
  ]
}
